mid_line_fence_prose {
    Same-line fences, glob `/**/`, URL `://`, and fenced ``` bodies must not open comments.
    Example: `@reqlan/*` in inline code must not open a block comment.
}

later_after_mid_line_ticks {
    This idea must remain visible after the mid-line triple backticks.
}

real_line_start_fence {
    A real fence follows:
    ```
    // not a reqlan comment
    ```
    After the fence this idea still closes.
}

after_real_fence {
    This idea must remain visible after a real line-start fence.
}
